sections.text:
Do not call the Telegram packet experience useful until:

- a normal question reaches the intended agent without exact-name guesswork;
- the selected packet is actually available to that answer;
- the answer addresses the question instead of the persona;
- the answer names its evidence;
- missing evidence yields a clear, actionable failure rather than a generic retry;
- the same battery passes twice without human relays.

No live business action occurred. One accidental message to the wrong human chat was immediately corrected; it is retained here as a product failure, not hidden as operator noise.
